  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening transitional justice processes in the Western Balkans - Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance accountability for war crimes in the Western Balkans and support regional cooperation among State Prosecutors in bringing perpetrators to justice and processing outstanding cases &#x2013; as part of the wider efforts in dealing with the legacies of the conflicts from the 1990s.</narrative>
  </description>
